---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Textcols from "../components/Textcols.astro";
import Heading from "../components/Heading.astro";
import Border from "../components/Border.astro";
import Starhover from "../components/Starhover.astro";
import Text from "../components/Text.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Our-services">
  <Textcols title="Our Sevices" textVers={2}
    ><Heading htmlheading="h2" size="xsmall"
      >We’re a passionate team of storytellers, working closely together across
      every stage of a production. With everything in-house, we bring ideas to
      life through strong collaboration, care and a shared drive to create
      meaningful, high-quality content.</Heading
    ></Textcols
  >
  <Border />
  <section class="pt-2xl lg:pt-5xl">
    <Textcols number="1" title="Development" textVers={3}>
      <Text variant="bodysmall"
        >Development is where ideas are welcomed and shaped together. No thought
        is too small, and every idea is taken seriously as we work closely to
        find the right story and direction.</Text
      ></Textcols
    ><Textcols number="2" title="Production" textVers={3}>
      <Text variant="bodysmall"
        >Production is where everything comes together. We work closely as a
        team to bring ideas to life, creating a calm and collaborative space
        where everyone plays a part in shaping the final result.</Text
      ></Textcols
    ><Textcols number="3" title="Editing" textVers={3}>
      <Text variant="bodysmall"
        >Editing is where the story finds its final form. We carefully select,
        refine and shape each moment, bringing clarity, rhythm and emotion to
        the finished production.</Text
      ></Textcols
    >
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 lg:pb-2xl">
      <div class="lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-4 lg:row-start-1">
        <Textcols number="4" title="Delivery" textVers={3}>
          <Text variant="bodysmall">
            Delivery is the final step, where the project is handed over and
            ready to be shared. We make sure everything is prepared, feels
            right, and reaches the audience just as it should.
          </Text>
        </Textcols>
      </div>

      <!-- Starhover optager 1 kolonne -->
      <div class="lg:col-end-2 lg:row-start-1 pl-gutter lg:pl-xl pb-2xl">
        <Starhover />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
